<title>USA: VTX Electronics Corp Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>VTX Electronics Corp Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGDALE, N.Y. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qtr	   Qtr    Nine mos    Nine mos</p>
<p>			  Ended	Ended	 Ended	 Ended</p>
<p>		     3/31/97	3/31/96     3/31/97     3/31/96</p>
<p> Net sales    $ 3,575,000 $ 7,452,000$ 18,395,000$ 21,588,000</p>
<p> Gross Margin     376,000   1,160,000   2,936,000   3,218,000</p>
<p>Net loss</p>
<p>attributable</p>
<p>to common stock</p>
<p>		  (1,963,000) (1,291,000) (4,435,000) (3,767,000)</p>
<p>Net loss per</p>
<p>   common share(A)  (.16)	 (.10)	 (.35)	 (.30)</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>shares</p>
<p>outstanding</p>
<p>		   12,652,000  12,652,000  12,652,000  12,652,000</p>
<p>(A) Net loss attributable to common stock for the quarter and nine months ended March 31, 1997 includes Chapter 11 Reorganization related expenses of approximately $278,000 which are a result of the company filing for Chapter 11 on January 10, 1997 and non-cash write-offs of approximately $561,000.  Net loss attributable to common stock for the nine months ended March 31, 1996 includes recapitalization related expenses of $298,000 which are non-recurring charges.</p>
<p>Vertex has reached a tentative agreement with the official committee of the Unsecured Creditors for their treatment under a plan of reorganization and expects to file such plan shortly.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
